; The scalar Loop program to structured SSA converter: the one route from the
; placed-graph lowering ([Loop_lower.lower_structured]) to the SSA passes and
; emitters, taken before precision planning, vectorization and contraction
; recognition. Depends on [loop_ir] and [ssa_ir] so neither depends on the
; other. Unwrapped: its modules keep the names the converter's consumers use.

(library
 (name ssa_of_loop)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt loop_ir native ssa_ir ssa_lower))
